---

This project builds on and interoperates with wire-pod
(https://github.com/kercre123/wire-pod) over its local HTTP/gRPC API — it
does not vendor or redistribute wire-pod's own code.

`wirepod-sdk-src/` contains a copy of Anki's original Vector Python SDK
(Copyright (c) 2018 Anki Inc.), licensed separately under Apache License
2.0 — see `wirepod-sdk-src/LICENSE.txt`. That license text and its
copyright notices must stay with those files; this repo's MIT license
applies only to the code written for this project, not to that vendored
SDK.
